    "title": "Memo detail page not refresh after editing and saving the content",
    "body": "### Pre-submission Checklist\n\n- [x] I have searched the existing issues and this bug has not been reported yet\n- [x] I have tested this issue on the [demo site](https://demo.usememos.com) or the latest version\n\n### Where did you encounter this bug?\n\nDemo site (demo.usememos.com)\n\n### Memos Version\n\nv0.26.2\n\n### Bug Description\n\nOn the memo details page, after editing and saving the content, the page still displays the old content before editing.\n\n### Steps to Reproduce\n\n1. Copy memo link using \"Copy Link\" menu\n2. Visit memo detail page with the link\n3. Edit memo content\n4. Click save button\n\n### Expected Behavior\n\nThe memo detail page should show the new content after edit, but it shows the old content, you have to refresh browser to get latest content.\n\n### Screenshots & Additional Context\n\n_No response_",
